; =====================================================================
; TRAB-Breakout v1.00 - H1 Donchian breakout (research best config)
; EA: TRAB_Breakout.mx5   |  attach to an H1 chart (EURUSD / USDCAD / USDJPY)
;
; This is the only TRAB prototype that was profitable in backtest
; (2023-25: EURUSD PF 1.19, USDCAD 1.55, USDJPY 1.12), but it is
; REGIME-DEPENDENT: it failed a 2018-2026 window (PF ~0.85-0.96).
; See docs/RESEARCH.md. FORWARD-TEST ON A DEMO FIRST - do not go live
; on backtest results alone.
; =====================================================================
InpEntryTF=16385
InpChannelTF=16385
InpChannelLen=10
InpUseCloseBreak=true
InpUsePullbackReentry=false
InpUseTrendFilter=false
InpATRPeriod=14
InpATRMultSL=2.5
InpTrailChannelLen=10
InpTrailATRMult=2.0
InpTrailActivateRR=1.0
InpUseTrailing=true
InpBreakevenRR=0.0
InpTakeProfitRR=0.0
InpMaxSLPips=0.0
InpMaxSpreadPips=2.0
InpMaxBarsInTrade=96
